<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Elevadores Atlas cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Elevadores Atlas cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Thomas Atkinson has cut his rating for Brazil's Elevadores Atlas SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a May 21 report, he wrote, &quot;Earnings have risen strongly, in line with our forecasts.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;... We continue to expect operations gains and rising earnings at Atlas, but the current share price is just six percent shy of our price target.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The shares closed Wednesday at 13.90 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
